<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling unchanged on dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling unchanged on dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzania shilling was unchanged on the dollar on Tuesday but strengthened against the pound, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a commercial mean rate of 621.7200 against the dollar unchanged from Monday. Against the pound the shilling traded at mean rate 1016.6692 from 1019.0022 on Monday, dealers said.</p>
</text>
